    ${result}    Get Lines Matching Regexp    ${output}    ${expected}    partial_match=${TRUE}
    ${contents_output}=   prepare egate cmd results log to console   ${output}
    Log to Console    ${contents_output}
    should contain    ${output}    aggregate MBR
    [Return]      ${output}

